+
+# Product analytics vendor: PostHog Cloud in the EU
+
+Decided on 2026-10-14 by [[Maya Okafor]] and [[Tom Lindqvist]].
+
+## Decision
+Product analytics switches to **PostHog Cloud in the EU region**.
+
+## Why
+Self-hosting PostHog is taking too much operations time while clinic data must stay in the EU.
+
+This replaces [[Decision - Product analytics vendor is PostHog self-hosted]], which is no longer current.
