+
+# Weekly sync, 2026-10-13
+
+Attendees: [[Maya Okafor]], [[Tom Lindqvist]], [[Priya Raman]], [[Daniel Reyes]], [[Sofia Marchetti]], [[Kenji Watanabe]]
+
+## Decisions
+- SMS reminders move to Sinch from 2026-11-01 (see [[Decision - SMS reminder provider is Sinch]]).
+- Support tool remains undecided; revisit in December after reviewing Plain's new pricing.
+
+## Discussion
+- Public launch happened on 2026-10-06 as planned. Early feedback from clinics is good.
+- Vonage is failing on Portuguese numbers too.
+- Several receptionists asked again for per-practitioner colours on the calendar.
+
+## Actions
+- [[Kenji Watanabe]] to stop the Vonage rollout; that task is no longer needed.
+- [[Priya Raman]] to redesign the SMS reminder templates for Sinch by 2026-10-30.
